flowchart LR
    TraderIn["Trader File Share<br/>DPS security file<br/>+ control file"]
    GatewayIn["ffc-pay-gateway<br/>Inbound Poller<br/>(poll window/days)"]
    BlobDPSIn["dps container<br/>inbound folder"]
    DpsParse["ffc-pay-dps<br/>Parse DPS file"]
    DpsPublish["ffc-pay-dps<br/>Publish DAX csv<br/>(FFC-prefixed filename)"]
    BlobDAXOut["dax container<br/>outbound folder"]
    GatewayOut["ffc-pay-gateway<br/>Outbound Transfer"]
    DAXSystem["D365 / DAX System"]
    BlobDPSArchive["dps container<br/>archive folder"]

    TraderIn -->|SFTP poll| GatewayIn
    GatewayIn -->|upload PENDING_ files| BlobDPSIn
    BlobDPSIn -->|poll pending files| DpsParse
    DpsParse -->|transform + add fields| DpsPublish
    DpsParse -.->|archive original| BlobDPSArchive
    DpsPublish -->|write DAX csv| BlobDAXOut
    BlobDAXOut -->|read by| GatewayOut
    GatewayOut -->|send to D365| DAXSystem
